Vestiaire Collective is an online platform that makes it easy to trade second-hand products between buyer and seller. Their business model is based on the recapture of luxury and high-value products from other brands. The service is base on the platform and they do not take ownership over the second-hand items, but facilitates direct exchange between buyer and seller. They have two different collaborative design approach, the first is base on peer to peer selling, the second is based business logistics selling. In the second option, the provider offers the extra service of verification and authentication of the luxury product made by experts, adding extra value to the product.